 * suite's results rather than encoded as a test:
 *
 *   grep -n "variation ===" index.tsx        -> no matches
 *   grep -n "switch (variation)" index.tsx   -> no matches
 *
 * Every layout/visibility decision in index.tsx instead reads from `VARIATION_CONFIG[variation]`
 * — a single object-property lookup, not a branching statement.
 */

